window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I made a deal with a sorcerer. I'll help him stop an evil nobody even knows exists yet. In exchange, he'll set me free of the monster that lives inside me.</b></p> <p>Sounds like a sweet deal, right?</p> <p>I thought so, but there's one thing I forgot to think about: Ax Creed.</p> <p>When I first met him, I thought he would be just like everyone else. I'm good at pushing people away, and they usually stay away for good.</p> <p>Not him. He pushes back just as hard. He got into my head, under my skin, and despite what we both are, he gives me hope. So I'm determined to do whatever it takes to get back to him, having no clue that he thinks I'm dead.</p> <p>What does Ax do when something he wants is taken from him? He becomes the Savage.</p> <p>Being on the run with him again fulfills my soul, but my freedom means too much to me, so I won't let myself stop. At the end of our journey, I'll have a choice to make: become his, everything else be damned, or ruin us for good.</p> <p>Damsel in Distress <i>is the second book in The Hidden Realm series, told from two POVs, packed with magic, mayhem, and romantic scenes intended for mature audiences.</i></p>"; 
